# A non-string element inside a Hider parameter array, entirely in the
# Option block -- unlike stringarray.rib, this never reaches WorldBegin, so
# it carries none of the other known leak that fixture's comment excludes.
# TokenVector::toRtTokenArray must release every string it had already
# duplicated before the element that throws, not just the pointer array.
Hider "hidden" "string tags" ["a" "b" 3]
